{
  "task": "K3a",
  "gate": ["GF-T16", "GF-T18"],
  "method": "prism/2",
  "writtenBeforeCode": true,
  "conventions": [
    "Coordinates and levels are local metres, passed as decimal strings. Area and volume are exact rationals.",
    "Footprints use the GeoJSON polygon layout: first ring is the exterior, later rings are holes.",
    "Prism volume = footprint area x (upperM - lowerM). A space total is the sum of its component volumes.",
    "Unknown limits stay unknown: no prism, no volume, never 0. Invalid input is unsupported with a reason code."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "rectangle",
      "arithmetic": [
        "Ring (0,0) (12.0,0) (12.0,8.5) (0,8.5): width 12.0, depth 8.5.",
        "Area = 12.0 x 8.5 = 102.0 m2 (12 x 8 = 96, 12 x 0.5 = 6).",
        "Height = 3.15 - 0.00 = 3.15 m.",
        "Volume = 102.0 x 3.15 = 306 + 15.3 = 321.3 m3."
      ],
      "input": {
        "spaceId": "space-rectangle",
        "components": [
          {
            "componentId": "c1",
            "levelId": "L0",
            "lowerM": "0.00",
            "upperM": "3.15",
            "verticalReference": "local:plinth-benchmark",
            "enclosure": "closed",
            "footprint": {
              "type": "Polygon",
              "coordinates": [[["0", "0"], ["12.0", "0"], ["12.0", "8.5"], ["0", "8.5"]]]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "state": "ok",
        "heightState": "known",
        "components": [{"areaM2Exact": "102", "volumeM3Exact": "321.3"}],
        "totalVolumeM3Exact": "321.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "l-shape-courtyard",
      "arithmetic": [
        "Outer L ring (0,0) (10,0) (10,4) (4,4) (4,9) (0,9), listed counter-clockwise.",
        "Decomposition: lower arm 10 x 4 = 40; leg above it 4 x 5 = 20; outer area = 60 m2.",
        "Shoelace check, sum of x_i*y_j - x_j*y_i: 0 + 40 + 24 + 20 + 36 + 0 = 120; 120 / 2 = 60 m2.",
        "Courtyard hole (1,1) (3.5,1) (3.5,2.5) (1,2.5), listed counter-clockwise (the engine must reverse it).",
        "It lies inside the lower arm (x 1..3.5 within 0..10, y 1..2.5 within 0..4). Hole area = 2.5 x 1.5 = 3.75 m2.",
        "Footprint area = 60 - 3.75 = 56.25 m2.",
        "Level 0.00..2.80 gives height 2.8 m.",
        "Volume = 56.25 x 2.8 = 112.5 + 45 = 157.5 m3.",
        "Cross-check: outer volume 60 x 2.8 = 168; hole volume 3.75 x 2.8 = 10.5; 168 - 10.5 = 157.5 m3.",
        "Normalised output: exterior counter-clockwise and closed; hole clockwise (first vertex kept, rest reversed) and closed."
      ],
      "input": {
        "spaceId": "space-l-shape",
        "components": [
          {
            "componentId": "c1",
            "levelId": "L0",
            "lowerM": "0.00",
            "upperM": "2.80",
            "verticalReference": "local:plinth-benchmark",
            "enclosure": "closed",
            "footprint": {
              "type": "Polygon",
              "coordinates": [
                [["0", "0"], ["10", "0"], ["10", "4"], ["4", "4"], ["4", "9"], ["0", "9"]],
                [["1", "1"], ["3.5", "1"], ["3.5", "2.5"], ["1", "2.5"]]
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "state": "ok",
        "heightState": "known",
        "components": [
          {
            "areaM2Exact": "56.25",
            "volumeM3Exact": "157.5",
            "footprint": [
              [
                [["0", "0"], ["10", "0"], ["10", "4"], ["4", "4"], ["4", "9"], ["0", "9"], ["0", "0"]],
                [["1", "1"], ["1", "2.5"], ["3.5", "2.5"], ["3.5", "1"], ["1", "1"]]
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "totalVolumeM3Exact": "157.5"
      },
      "decomposition": {
        "outerAreaM2Exact": "60",
        "outerVolumeM3Exact": "168",
        "holeRing": [["1", "1"], ["3.5", "1"], ["3.5", "2.5"], ["1", "2.5"]],
        "holeAreaM2Exact": "3.75",
        "holeVolumeM3Exact": "10.5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "duplex-empty-slab",
      "arithmetic": [
        "One unit identity (space-duplex), two prism components, one per level.",
        "Level L1 limits 3.30..6.30 (height 3.00), footprint 9.0 x 6.0 = 54 m2, volume 54 x 3.00 = 162 m3.",
        "Level L2 limits 6.60..9.60 (height 3.00), unequal footprint 9.0 x 4.5 = 40.5 m2, volume 40.5 x 3.00 = 121.5 m3.",
        "The intermediate slab 6.30..6.60 (0.30 m) belongs to neither component, so it is empty.",
        "Total volume = 162 + 121.5 = 283.5 m3.",
        "Wrong answer to reject: union footprint 54 x full span (9.60 - 3.30 = 6.30) = 340.2 m3 (54 x 6 = 324, 54 x 0.3 = 16.2)."
      ],
      "input": {
        "spaceId": "space-duplex",
        "components": [
          {
            "componentId": "c1",
            "levelId": "L1",
            "lowerM": "3.30",
            "upperM": "6.30",
            "verticalReference": "local:plinth-benchmark",
            "enclosure": "closed",
            "footprint": {
              "type": "Polygon",
              "coordinates": [[["0", "0"], ["9", "0"], ["9", "6"], ["0", "6"]]]
            }
          },
          {
            "componentId": "c2",
            "levelId": "L2",
            "lowerM": "6.60",
            "upperM": "9.60",
            "verticalReference": "local:plinth-benchmark",
            "enclosure": "closed",
            "footprint": {
              "type": "Polygon",
              "coordinates": [[["0", "0"], ["9", "0"], ["9", "4.5"], ["0", "4.5"]]]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "state": "ok",
        "heightState": "known",
        "components": [
          {"areaM2Exact": "54", "volumeM3Exact": "162"},
          {"areaM2Exact": "40.5", "volumeM3Exact": "121.5"}
        ],
        "totalVolumeM3Exact": "283.5"
      },
      "rejectedNaiveVolumeM3Exact": "340.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "unknown-limits",
      "arithmetic": [
